      {
        "body_block": 157,
        "original": "$⇒ Δ A B C$và $Δ B C D$ đều cạnh $2 a .$",
        "corrected": "\t\t\t\t    $⇒ Δ A B D$và $Δ B C D$ đều cạnh $2 a .$",
        "reason": "For angle BAD=60°, the equilateral triangles are ABD and BCD."
      },
      {
        "body_block": 169,
        "original": "$cases(display(S H = frac(sqrt(3), 2) . 2 a = a sqrt(3)), display(H K = frac(a, 2)))$ $⇒ H I = frac(a ^(2) . sqrt(3) . frac(1, 2), a . sqrt(3 + frac(1, 4))) = frac(sqrt(39), 13)$ $⇒ d lr(( H \";\" lr(( S A C )) )) = frac(a sqrt(39), 13)$  (2).",
        "corrected": "\t\t\t\t$cases(display(S H = frac(sqrt(3), 2) . 2 a = a sqrt(3)), display(H K = frac(a, 2)))$ $⇒ H I = frac(a ^(2) . sqrt(3) . frac(1, 2), a . sqrt(3 + frac(1, 4))) = frac(a sqrt(39), 13)$ $⇒ d lr(( H \";\" lr(( S A C )) )) = frac(a sqrt(39), 13)$  (2).",
        "reason": "Restore the missing length scale a."
