      {
        "body_block": 187,
        "original": "+) Nét 3: Kẻ $H K ⊥ S D ⇒ d lr(( H \";\" lr(( S A C )) )) = H K = frac(S H . H D, sqrt(S H ^(2) + H D ^(2))) .$",
        "corrected": "\t\t\t\t+) Nét 3: Kẻ $H K ⊥ S D ⇒ d lr(( H \";\" lr(( S C D )) )) = H K = frac(S H . H D, sqrt(S H ^(2) + H D ^(2))) .$",
        "reason": "The target plane in this problem is SCD."
      },
      {
        "body_block": 188,
        "original": "Có: $H I = frac(S H . H K, sqrt(S H ^(2) + H K ^(2))) .$",
        "corrected": "Có: $H K = frac(S H . H D, sqrt(S H ^(2) + H D ^(2)))$.",
        "reason": "Use the actual altitude HK in right triangle SHD; source reused unrelated HI/HK formula."
      },
      {
        "body_block": 189,
        "original": "$cases(display(S H = frac(sqrt(3), 2) . 2 a = a sqrt(3)), display(H K = frac(sqrt(3), 2) . 2 a = a sqrt(3)))$ $⇒ d lr(( H \";\" lr(( S C D )) )) = frac(a ^(2) . sqrt(3) . sqrt(3), a . sqrt(3 + 3)) = frac(3, sqrt(6)) . a = frac(a sqrt(6), 2)$ $⇒ d lr(( H \";\" lr(( S C D )) )) = frac(a sqrt(6), 2)$ (2)",
        "corrected": "\t\t\t\t$cases(display(S H = frac(sqrt(3), 2) . 2 a = a sqrt(3)), display(H D = frac(sqrt(3), 2) . 2 a = a sqrt(3)))$ $⇒ d lr(( H \";\" lr(( S C D )) )) = frac(a ^(2) . sqrt(3) . sqrt(3), a . sqrt(3 + 3)) = frac(3, sqrt(6)) . a = frac(a sqrt(6), 2)$ $⇒ d lr(( H \";\" lr(( S C D )) )) = frac(a sqrt(6), 2)$ (2)",
