      {
        "body_block": 199,
        "original": "$⇒ A B = sqrt(S A ^(2) + A B ^(2)) = a sqrt(2)$.",
        "corrected": "\t\t\t\t$⇒ A B = sqrt(S A ^(2) + S B ^(2)) = a sqrt(2)$.",
        "reason": "Pythagoras in triangle SAB: AB²=SA²+SB²."
